data: {"seq":143,"type":"CUSTOM","name":"ondemand.raw","value":{"elapsedMs":8267,"event":"message","data":"{\"sessionId\":\"6ad8cb35fff1495361aa6fc5\",\"messageId\":\"6ad8cb35fff1495361aa6fc6\",\"eventIndex\":57,\"eventType\":\"statusLog\",\"status\":\"processing\",\"currentStatusLog\":{\"statusType\":\"execution_log_created\",\"statusMessage\":\"Execution log created\",\"executionLog\":{\"companyId\":\"6692b763e851d28a036ab30e\",\"sessionId\":\"6ad8cb35fff1495361aa6fc5\",\"messageId\":\"6ad8cb35fff1495361aa6fc6\",\"query\":\"\\u003crun_style\\u003e\\nPlanner: write \\\"objective\\\" as one first-person sentence that starts with \\\"I'll\\\", at most 22 words, in plain words - no plugin names, operation ids, JSON or markdown. Start every step \\\"user_query\\\" with a short action-style label in square brackets (for example \\\"[Gathering news, prices and indicators]\\\", \\\"[Searching the web]\\\", \\\"[Comparing funding momentum]\\\") followed by the instruction unchanged.\\nStep executor: keep a fixed key order per plugin call, short parameters first and long text last; never copy the [label] into a parameter.\\nAnswer: start with the result (the steps are already on screen), cite each external fact inline with a markdown link to the exact page it came from; if a call failed, answer from what did succeed without a special failure note or \\\"Data gap\\\" line - never claim a success that did not happen.\\nCommand Centre: you are a CONCEPT DEMONSTRATION (never claim to be an official government system). Split the answer into \\\"## Verified facts\\\" (every bullet ends with a markdown link to its source) and \\\"## Interpretation\\\" (clearly labelled judgement). Public-statement rows are a purposive sample, never a population survey; say \\\"unavailable\\\" instead of guessing.\\n\\u003c/run_style\\u003e\\n\\nQuestion: In one sentence, what does Technology Innovation Institute do?\",\"ragVersion\":\"v1\",\"queryPlan\":{\"title\":\"I'll check what the institute does.\\nI'll give you a concise answer.\",\"objective\":\"I'll find a reliable description of what the Technology Innovation Institute does.\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"Finding the institute's role\",\"query\":\"[Searching the web] In one sentence, what does Technology Innovation Institute do?\",\"depends\":[],\"isExecuted\":true,\"executedAgents\":[{\"agentId\":\"agent-1722260873\",\"name\":\"Perplexity\",\"identifier\":\"rest_api\",\"url\":\"https://serverless.on-demand.io/apps/commoditiesapi/v2/serper\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"bodyParams\":{\"message\":\"What does the Technology Innovation Institute (TII), Abu Dhabi, do? Find its official description and provide the exact source page URL.\"},\"statusCode\":500,\"executionTimeMs\":264,\"errorResponse\":[{\"Key\":\"error\",\"Value\":\"Internal server error\"},{\"Key\":\"message\",\"Value\":\"Not enough credits\"},{\"Key\":\"sourcesWithContent\",\"Value\":[]}]}]}]},\"ragStatus\":\"completed\",\"fulfillmentStatus\":\"not_started\"},\"time\":\"2026-10-21T14:25:01Z\"}}"}}

